 513:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * used for this activity towards other CPUs.
 514:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
