 582:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to Enable or disable the CPU performance counters based on the input parameter.
 583:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 584:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API can be used to enable or disable performance counter of only the caller CPU. It cannot 
 585:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * used for this activity towards other CPUs.
